// name :
"P329527412" "Good Villains Never Die"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SavedClone 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2134807286" "Saving Yourself"
// DetailString :
"P2124820558" "You saved one of your downed clones inside of the cloning facility, despite the threat of it blowing up any second. The clone used some device to teleport out of the lab."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DeanClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3650275609" "Dean MacArthur's Past"
// DetailString :
"P3842503767" "While rummaging through the PPD files, you found some information about Dean. It seems he was a former PPD officer who is now wanted for the murder of Francesco Lorenzo. You may want to speak with Dean about this when you get the chance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RampgerDeal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1696721977" "Freakshow Deal"
// DetailString :
"P2205314866" "You defeated Rampager of the Freakshow within his warehouse. He grumbled that if you actually managed to defeat the rest of his gang, you would have the aid of the Freakshow in raiding Independence Port - as long as you agreed to help free Killdozer.<br><br>Of course, this was all said in Freak-speak, so it took a few moments for you to parse what Rampager was <i>actually</i> saying."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeOneClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P979309394" "Good Villains Never Die"
// DetailString :
"P2642219749" "It all began when a man named Leonard contacted you about enhancing your clone facility. He worked for Mane Corp, a corporation that was trying to reach the leagues of Crey and Aeon Corp.<br><br>You agreed to work together with him, wary of what may come from it. In no time at all, Mane Corp had your facility up and running. Your presence was requested to test the combat abilities of your clones. It took a few tries, but the scientists in the facility were able to create an exact clone of you! With that success, there was one thing still left to do - find out more information on Mane Corp. You needed something else you could use against them aside from your sheer power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeTwoClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P282341031" "It all began when a man named Leonard contacted you about enhancing your clone facility. He worked for Mane Corp, a corporation that was trying to reach the leagues of Crey and Aeon Corp.<br><br>You agreed to work together with him, wary of what may come from it. In no time at all, Mane Corp had your facility up and running. Your presence was requested to test the combat abilities of your clones. It took a few tries, but the scientists in the facility were able to create an exact clone of you! With that success, there was one thing still left to do - find out more information on Mane Corp. You needed something else you could use against them aside from your sheer power.<br><br>Dean MacArthur played a critical role in helping you find this information. You gained the aid of the Freakshow - by force - to assault a portion of Independence Port. During the chaos, you retrieved the PPD files on Mane Corp. You discovered that Thomas Mane had siphoned all the funds from Mane Corp into a private account within the Isles, then fled to the Isles when the PPD tried to arrest him. His bodyguard, Leonard, was sent to deal with Mane, but supposedly had joined him.<br><br>Dean helped you track down where Thomas Mane was - old warehouse within Sharkhead. You went in there, only to discover that it was a base for the 5th Column! You also found Leonard deep inside of the warehouse. He revealed that Thomas Mane had been killed by the shapeshifter Protean, who was impersonating Leonard the entire time!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SouvenirGoodVillainsNeverDie 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P148149892" "The Cries of Clones"
// tDetailString :
"P1926442712" "Sometimes, late at night, you can hear the screams of your clones, begging you to save them from being burned alive. When you focus yourself, the cries go away, as if it's just a lingering memory. A memory that reminds you of an experience called...<br><br><b>Good Villains Never Die</b><br><br>It all began when a man named Leonard contacted you about enhancing your clone facility. He worked for Mane Corp, a corporation that was trying to reach the leagues of Crey and Aeon Corp.<br><br>You agreed to work together with him, wary of what may come from it. In no time at all, Mane Corp had your facility up and running. Your presence was requested to test the combat abilities of your clones. It took a few tries, but the scientists in the facility were able to create an exact clone of you! With that success, there was one thing still left to do - find out more information on Mane Corp. You needed something else you could use against them aside from your sheer power.<br><br>Dean MacArthur played a critical role in helping you find this information. You gained the aid of the Freakshow - by force - to assault a portion of Independence Port. During the chaos, you retrieved the PPD files on Mane Corp. You discovered that Thomas Mane had siphoned all the funds from Mane Corp into a private account within the Isles, then fled to the Isles when the PPD tried to arrest him. His bodyguard, Leonard, was sent to deal with Mane, but supposedly had joined him.<br><br>Dean helped you track down where Thomas Mane was - old warehouse within Sharkhead. You went in there, only to discover that it was a base for the 5th Column! You also found Leonard deep inside of the warehouse. He revealed that Thomas Mane had been killed by the shapeshifter Protean, who was impersonating Leonard the entire time!<br><br>You went to retake your facility, fighting through the 5th Column soldiers that were now in place. At the bottom of the clone facility, you came face to face with Protean, overhearing that he was working for a man in Praetoria called 'Mr. G.' You fought Protean and defeated him, but in his final act of defiance, Protean launched a self-destruct sequence to destroy the facility. You were able to escape, but the facility, and your work, was lost.<br><br>However...Protean would not walk away with total victory. You were able to find out the information on Protean's account, allowing you to siphon all <i>his</i> money for yourself. You know this will slow Protean down whenever he tries to restart his activities. Some may believe that the blast - and your fight - killed Protean. But there's one thing that you know from personal experience:<br><br>Good villains never die."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Higgins 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1543161837" "Hello {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}.<br><br>We're finishing up a few things on our end here, but preparations for our first test are almost complete!<br><br>We're very proud with the progress we've made in this short amount of time. Everything is just about ready to go for your trial run inside, we'll just need to clarify one last thing."
// Answer Text :
"P3733956995" "What is it?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1399260683" "Well...we'll be testing to see how well the cloning system works for yourself, correct?<br><br>Which means we'll be sending out <color orange>three waves of clones for you to face.</color><br><br>Each one is using a different method that we have for cloning - we'll use the tests to determine which one is the most successful. <br><br>What we need to know from you is how many of your clones you'd like us to send out at a time."
// Answer Text :
"P1924794088" "What are the options?"
// Page Options Text :
"P1965525080" "We can send out as little as one clone in each wave or as many as <color red>eight clones</color> in each wave. <br><br><color red>Though I would not advise fighting more than three clones by yourself.</color><br><br>How many shall we set the program for?"
// Answer Text :
"P3949973723" "Just one."
// Answer Text :
"P799273770" "I'll fight two."
// Answer Text :
"P3074926772" "Let's go for three."
// Answer Text :
"P2047122744" "I'm down for four."
// Answer Text :
"P3940948564" "Let's try five."
// Answer Text :
"P3016792209" "I'm feeling six clones."
// Answer Text :
"P753423881" "Set it to seven clones."
// Answer Text :
"P3841712938" "Send out all eight clones."
// Page OneClone Text :
"P3583677267" "Very good {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}. I'll go ahead and get the program set up for just one clone."
// Answer Text :
"P70252942" "Excellent."
// Page TwoClones Text :
"P3917880719" "Very good {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}. I'll go ahead and get the program set up to send out two clones."
// Page ThreeClones Text :
"P192159328" "Very good {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}. I'll go ahead and get the program set up to send out three clones."
// Page FourClones Text :
"P2775623826" "Are you sure {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}? Four clones might be a bit too much to handle at once - even for someone with your abilities."
// Answer Text :
"P4253907076" "Yes, I'm sure."
// Answer Text :
"P3375924710" "Hrm, what were my options again?"
// Page FourClonesSure Text :
"P1859527770" "Alright. I'll go ahead and prepare everything for you. Good luck {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}."
// Answer Text :
"P318722531" "Perfect."
// Page FiveClones Text :
"P890965688" "Are you sure {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}? Five clones might be a bit too much to handle at once - even for someone with your abilities."
// Page SixClones Text :
"P795104858" "Are you sure {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}? Six clones might be a bit too much to handle at once - even for someone with your abilities."
// Page SevenClones Text :
"P1182462549" "Are you sure {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}? Seven clones might be a bit too much to handle at once - even for someone with your abilities."
// Page EightClones Text :
"P3631836944" "<color red>Eight clones?</color><br><br>{Hero.gender=male Sir|Ma'am}, even for yourself, this may be too much. <color red>I would only do this if you have some cohorts of your own to assist you in this task.</color><br><br>Do you really want to go through with this?"
// Answer Text :
"P3593969611" "Yes, prepare all of the clones!"
// Page EightClonesSure Text :
"P2376901471" "Alright... <br><br>I'll go ahead and get...everything ready for you. Good luck {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Zeist 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P536118113" "Hello {HeroName}, you did quite well against those clones. I'm happy to say that we'll have this cloning technology perfected in no time, thanks to our...mutual friends over in Mane Corp.<br><br>Was there something else you wanted?"
// Answer Text :
"P1398185658" "What do you know about Mane Corp?"
// Page Second Text :
"P2269585338" "I'm sorry that I can't be of more help to you, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P1153453712" "Just keep doing your work."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3790710" "Hrm? Aside from what was given out on that dossier?<br><br>Nothing much, I'm afraid. We at Crey looked down on Mane Corp for quite some time.<br><br>There were some threats here and there from the company in the past few years, but as of late the company had been oddly silent.<br><br>With <i>this</i>, however, I can see them making a comeback.<br><br>If you allowed them, of course."
// Answer Text :
"P3218175079" "I need more information on our benefactor. The head of Mane Corp."
// Page Info Text :
"P3466144374" "I wish I could tell you, {HeroName}, but none of us know much about him. Aside from his name, of course - <color yellow>Thomas Mane</color><br><br> All I know is that he has plenty of money and wants to invest it in this.<br><br>If I were you, I would talk to that Leonard, though I imagine you might not want to set off any alarms by talking to him, hm?"
// Answer Text :
"P2395618458" "Right...I'll think of something. Carry on."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P976503788" "Very well, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4266490204" "Hello {HeroName}.<br><br>Let me begin by saying it's a pleasure to be working with you on this project. Your head scientists are currently working very hard to get the cloning facility up and running. With the help from our scientists, technicians, and guards, I believe that we're on the cusp of getting the facility operational.<br><br>I have been contacted by your head scientist, <color yellow>Dr. Higgins</color>.<br><br>He requests that you go to your facility when you have a moment."
// AcceptString :
"P3108787210" "What do they want?"
// SendOffString :
"P684964565" "Dr. Higgins says that they require your abilities to put the clones they're creating to the test. I believe they want to avoid the mess that happened with your battle with Ajax. That is, having a defective clone of yourself.<br><br>The guards know to give you a pass through the facility, so you'll have no worry.<br><br>Should you need something from myself or Mane Corp, please do not hesitate to ask."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2243148720" "Test out your clones"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3310515848" "Yes, {HeroName}? Is the facility to your liking?"
// TaskTitle :
"P4026601398" "<color deepskyblue>Good Villains Never Die</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P402789541" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: Revisions</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P282015997" "You passed by some heavy security in the facility. Sandbags set up for an attack, as well as turrets being constructed. <br><br>No one in the Isles will even <i>think</i> about trying to attack your facility when all is said and done."
// Script Variable OBJECT_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1309515122" "Generator"
// Script Variable OBJECT_DISPLAYINFO :
"P1003658439" "This generator, provided by Mane Corp, is helping to give full power to all systems within the cloning facility."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2332903851" "Mane Corp Scientist"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P1057185511" "This scientist was hired on by Mane Corp to help run the clone facility."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4153379252" "We're working as hard as we can here, {HeroName}. No worries."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2698161016" "Ex-Crey Guard"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P3607222401" "Mane Corp has hired the former security from Crey to guard the premises of the cloning facility. Extensive background checks have been performed on each of them to ensure that they are not leaking any information from the lab to Crey."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2511871970" "Dr. Higgins"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P2936411872" "Dr. Higgins used to be one of the top Crey Scientists, until he joined forces with you to help get this clone factory up and running."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2570308137" "Hello {HeroName}. We have all the preparations ready for the first tests. Let's just go over a few last minute details."

