"P2908734129" "Dr. Zeist"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P2053751595" "Dr. Zeist is a young and ambitious doctor, willing to do whatever it takes to make a name for himself, even if it means getting involved in experimental cloning procedures."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1015129222" "Hello {HeroName}, I see the tests went well."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3299213932" "I'm taking you down, {HeroName}! The Rogue Isles belong to ME!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Zeist 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P4236336796" "Speak with Dr. Zeist"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4037873047" "The clones are working perfectly now. But something still doesn't sit right about Mane Corp. They were able to get this off the ground very quickly. If you're going to work together with them, you'll have to get some dirt to use on the corporation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4241878315" "I heard the tests went quite well, {HeroName}. I'm very excited for that. This is going to be a terrific experience for both yourself and for Mane Corp. <br><br>It's only a matter of time now until your clone army is built up and Mane Corp is elevated beyond the fools within Crey and Aeon Corp."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DeanFirst 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3860006615" "Yo, {HeroName}! <br><br>{Hero.gender=male Are you here to knock back a few drinks?|You here to ask me out on a date? D-Mac has plenty of time for you!}"
// Answer Text :
"P2339934176" "No Dean, I need information."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1005709722" "Oh.<br><br>That's cool! I was just totally thinking of you, you know, of all the crazy times we had.<br><br>Remember that time you ran into your clone? I was all going on about Ajax, and you went, 'My clone is more important' and I was like, 'Whaaaat! A clone! That's right!'. <br><br>Haha...so anyway, what's up? What can {Hero.gender=male Dean|D-Mac} do for you?"
// Answer Text :
"P1092150249" "I need you to get me some information on Mane Corp."
// Page ManeCorp Text :
"P1606039199" "Huh? Mane Corp?<br><br>Isn't that the corporation helping you out with that clone stuff?<br><br>Ohhh, you're clever, I see what you're doing! Huh...okay...uhm...let's see...okay! Yeah I know the exact guy who can locate that info.<br><br><color orange>Dean takes out his phone and sends a quick text message.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1362375243" "(Wait for the reply)"
// Page Waitforit Text :
"P145426776" "<color pink>Dean's phone plays a pop song popular with teenage high school girls. He bobs his head to it for a moment before checking the message.</color><br><br>Rock! Okay this guy knows his stuff. It's that pal of mine in the Sky Raiders. He's kind of a mook but man he makes a wicked bunch of raviolis. Am I right or am I right? I kinda think he should be in the Family, but he's feelin' the Sky Raiders more.<br><br>So okay, he says that the <color yellow>PPD precinct in Independence Port could have the files you need on Mane Corp.</color><br><br> See, usually they keep this stuff in Kings Row, but I had a feeling the guys in the PPD would be moving that info around.</color><br><br>There's just one problem though.<br><br>....<br><br>....<br><br>....."
// Answer Text :
"P293081484" ".... .... What's the problem?"
// Page Problem Text :
"P2262465481" "I'm glad you asked!<br><br>So that place has high security, you know? Meaning that if you went in there, it'll be real obvious to those guys in Mane Corp what you were up to.<br><br>So there's gotta be another way to go about this.<br><br><color orange>From your knowledge of the Isles, you know that a group like the Freakshow would be willing to lend you their aid - so long as you proved to them that you can take them in a fight. It's just a matter of finding a Freakshow cell that needs to get into Paragon."
// Answer Text :
"P1394735941" "Dean, I need you to find a Freakshow group that's going into Paragon."
// Page Freakshow Text :
"P3351927765" "I already know one!<br><br>Take a moment and bask in {Hero.gender=male Dean's|D-Mac's} knowledge of the streets, yeah!<br><br>So check it, this guy, his name's <color yellow>Killdozer</color>, he's rotting right now in the PPD jail, yeah?<br><br>Freakshow guy by the name of Rampager is trying to organize his guys to get in there and save Killdozer.<br><br>He's in a warehouse in Sharkhead, I'll totally write down the address for you. He's meeting up with his lieutenants now.<br><br><color orange>You come to the conclusion that if you show Rampager and his other Freakshow who holds the power around here, you can get them to help you into Independence Port, while also making a promise that you'll help them save Killdozer. Of course, it is your decision whether or not you <i>actually</i> help them rescue this Freak."
// Answer Text :
"P1884707968" "Excellent work Dean. We'll talk again soon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Freakshow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3508019505" "{HeroName}! Time to live up to your end of the bargain!<br><br>We helped stir up some trouble for you here in the IP, now you gotta help us break out Killdozer!"
// Answer Text :
"P3309882455" "Deal's off, I've still got more work to do."
// Answer Text :
"P574338117" "Let's get Killdozer."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P124427779" "Hrmph...should've known. We ain't gonna forget this {HeroName}! <br><br>Come on guys, we're outta here!"
// Answer Text :
"P112862696" "Good riddance."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P443620494" "Yeah! Alright, we'll go outside and make sure none of them rats get in here, you gotta break out Killdozer from downstairs!"
// Answer Text :
"P4135781192" "Leave it to me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PPDFiles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1216558629" "<color orange>You crack open this crate to find a number of PPD files, all neatly organized. You can easily access anything you want by just looking up the proper folders. What do you want to find?</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P210900441" "(Look up information on Mane Corp)"
// Answer Text :
"P817683464" "(Look up information on yourself)"
// Answer Text :
"P1918302640" "(Look for information on anyone else)"
// Page MainMenu Text :
"P1430783799" "<color orange>You can easily access anything you want by just going to the proper folders. What do you want to look up?</color>"
// Page Dean Text :
"P441568630" "<color orange>You flip the various files, looking for anything interesting. One file catches your eye. It's about Dean. You open it up and read it over...</color><br><br><color CadetBlue>Name:<br><br> Dean MacArthur<br><br>Gender:<br><br>Male<br><br>Age:<br><br> 27<br><br>Occupation:<br><br> Former PPD Officer<br><br>Known Family:<br><br> Father - Franklin MacArthur - DECEASED (Murdered)<br><br>Mother - Emily MacArthur - DECEASED (Natural causes)<br><br>Charges: <br><br>Murder of Francesco 'The Boss' Lorenzo.<br><br>Current Location:<br><br> Rogue Isles"
// Answer Text :
"P2189418812" "(Look for other information)"
// Page DeaconCorp Text :
"P2061327867" "<color CadetBlue>MANE CORP<br><br>Founded in 1994 by Jonathan Deacon, Thomas Mane, and Leonard Milton.<br><br>In 1998 Jonathan Deacon handed over rights to Thomas Mane.<br><br>Thomas Mane spent ten years trying to raise Mane Corp to the level of Crey Industries, but to no avail.<br><br>Every technological advancement made by Mane Corp was overshadowed by the leaps and bounds that Crey was taking.<br><br>Activity from Mane Corp died down in 2008.<br><br>All was silent until recently, when <color red>Thomas Mane bankrupted the company by siphoning all of its funds to a private account in the Rogue Isles.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3026707050" "(Look up information on Thomas Mane)"
// Page Mane Text :
"P1238250293" "<color CadetBlue>NAME: <br><br>Thomas Mane.<br><br>GENDER: <br><br>Male<br><br>AGE:<br><br> 44<br><br>BIRTHPLACE: <br><br>New Hampshire<br><br>OCCUPATION:<br><br> <color red>Former President of Mane Corp</color><br><br><color CadetBlue>LAST KNOWN MOVEMENT: <br><br>Thomas Mane, some weeks ago, was caught transferring all of the funds of his company, Mane Corp, into a private account held in the Rogue Isles.<br><br>We attempted to arrest him, but he fled before we could do so. <br><br>We are currently trying to get cooperation from Arachnos, but that's going as well as it sounds.<br><br>Mane's bodyguard, Leonard, has recently offered to go to the Isles to lure Mane back. Unfortunately, we have not heard from Leonard since.<br><br>We suspect he has either been captured by Mane, or has joined up with his former employer.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1778255327" "(Copy the files down, then burn the remaining folders!)"
// Page BurnBabyBurn Text :
"P1404069628" "<color orange>The folders all catch fire easily, burning in a manner of moments. You hear the sounds of footsteps pounding towards you - one of the heroes from Paragon has arrived!"
// Answer Text :
"P1669660963" "And here I thought this was going to be boring..."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P3414416920" "<color orange>You do some digging to find the file that the PPD has on you...</color><br><br><color CadetBlue>NAME: <br><br>{HeroName}<br><br>SUSPECTED ORIGIN:<br><br> {HeroOrigin}<br><br>COMBAT CLASSIFICATION:<br><br> {HeroClass}<br><br>LAST KNOWN MOVEMENT:<br><br> {HeroName} was one of the last people to see Ajax. One of our agents in the Isles reports {HeroName} was working with a man named Dean to get rid of Ajax. <br><br>We are currently unable to locate Ajax - all leads for him have gone cold."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P1781926359" "Alright, Alright. I'll tell you everything I know."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DeanSecond 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1702206874" "Yo {HeroName}, I totally saw the Freakshow rampaging in the Port! Yeaaaah!<br><br>I was all proud, knowing I helped out with that, bringing down the man one guy at a time, you dig?<br><br>So what's up? What can the Deanster do for you today?"
// Answer Text :
"P1724349760" "Thomas Mane. He's somewhere here in the Isles. I need to find him."
// Page Mane Text :
"P1751041252" "Thomas Mane huh?<br><br>Yeah sure, no problem, I can find him for you. Let's see...lemme get a pic of him on my phone...<br><br>...oookay. Man that guy is <i>not</i> good looking.<br><br>Okay...let me send the pic to some of my bros out here, see if anyone has found anything..."
// Answer Text :
"P4223691795" "(Wait for someone to reply)"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P2259509139" "<color pink>Once again, Dean's phone rings with a girly pop song.</color><br><br>Bingo! Okay, so I got a bro in Arachnos, yeah?<br><br>Says he saw this guy walking in and out of an old warehouse nearby.<br><br>Even better, he said he's seen that Leonard guy going there too! I guess that's why my man joined Arachnos, dude goes above and beyond the call of duty, you know?<br><br>Me, if I was a betting man, that must be where they're running Mane Corp now, you know?"
// Answer Text :
"P3312710272" "I do know. Thanks Dean."
// Answer Text :
"P2705717987" "Before we go Dean, I found some information. On you."
// Page InterestingInfo Text :
"P2077494875" "Eh? What're you talking about?"
// Answer Text :
"P1200979194" "That you used to be in the PPD."
// Page PPDExplain Text :
"P2880651160" "Man...you're going to get this thing started on being serious and all that stuff huh?<br><br>Alright, yeah sure, okay, I'll tell you what went down with the D-Mac. You deserve to know, yeah? I mean, we're not <i>strangers</i> or anything.<br><br>So yeah, it's totally true that I was in the PPD. I was just a regular cop though, yeah? Nothing special, not high-ranking, not some sorta action-hero taking down helicopters stuff."
// Answer Text :
"P2808009042" "Go on..."
// Page PPDExplain2 Text :
"P1398298989" "So one day, my pop, good guy, he's killed. Real bad stuff. I know I might be sounding all casual about it now, but it's just 'cause I'm over it.<br><br>Me, I wasn't the kinda guy to rally the troops to try to track down this guy. I handled my own stuff with my dad dying while they looked for the guy who killed him.<br><br>That's when everything just collapsed, yeah? They found the guy, <color yellow>Francesco Lorenzo</color>. <br><br>It was supposed to be an open and shut case, you know?"
// Answer Text :
"P588491448" "I'm assuming it wasn't."
// Page PPDExplain3 Text :
"P1849671160" "Not at all {Hero.gender=male man|babe}. Dude had one of the best defense attorneys around, meanwhile, we got a prosecuter who didn't know up from down.<br><br>Worst part of it? The murder weapon, the one that they freakin' <i>found</i>?<br><br>Defense attorney had it thrown out of court 'cause the cops <color yellow>didn't get the warrant to search Lorenzo's place for it.</color><br><br>All that added up to this guy getting off scott free for <i>murder</i>, when everyone knew he did it!<br><br><i>Man</i>, I was angry."
// Answer Text :
"P3316424666" "So you took justice into your own hands."
// Page PPDExplain4 Text :
"P3751574924" "Of course I did! Guy had it comin' to him, you know?<br><br>I figured that the law is supposed to serve the people, yeah? So when it doesn't, a man has gotta handle things on his own.<br><br>I killed that guy, shot him right in the head. No prob.<br><br>Unfortunately for me, my 'friends' in the PPD didn't look the other way. They got a warrant to search my place and for my arrest!<br><br>Guys I worked with for years, I even was in the freakin' academy with one guy that was sent to arrest me!<br><br>No way I was gonna just let myself rot in jail though, not when I didn't do anything wrong."
// Answer Text :
"P517725427" "Which led you to flee to the Isles."
// Page PPDExplain5 Text :
"P3972778644" "Yeah. I got away from them of course, I knew all the secret routes outta the city - had to in order to do my job.<br><br>They can't reach me here though cause of jurisdiction issues.<br><br>Ever since then, my whole view on stuff has changed, big time, yeah? Like a balloon being blown up and then POPPING.<br><br>The Isles, great place, someone wrongs you, there's no legal loopholes to go through. You just go take them down, and if anyone's got a problem with it, you take 'em down too. Might makes right, that's the way to live baby!<br><br>That's why I wanna help folks like you. Paragon hates what you're doin', which means I'm totally on your side. Everyone over there, rotten to the core man, they just don't know it yet. Here, at least, everything is open, you know what's going on!<br><br>Way I see it, me helpin' you out is me takin' the fight back to Paragon, in my own way. Nothing wrong with that, yeah?"
// Answer Text :
"P2390022433" "We're fine as long as you don't go running back to the PPD."
// Page ParagonWillFall Text :
"P1416755473" "Yeah! That's what I'm talking about!<br><br>Me and you, we're destined for greatness, you {Hero.gender=male know?|know? And maybe some romantic tension down the line. Maybe even more than tension, eh eh?}<br><br>Like I said, you ever need <i>anything</i>, you give me a ring. I'm done with Paragon, forever, but I'm gonna make sure they'll be rememberin' my name!"
// Answer Text :
"P4075799409" "Excellent Dean. I'll speak to you again soon."
// Page WrongTree Text :
"P2407284408" "Yeah, maybe. <i>Maybe</i>. All I know is that you and me, we took down a hero stompin' around here in the Isles, trying to make this place like Paragon.<br><br>Maybe we don't share the same exact goals. But I know helpin' you out makes sense to me. So I'm gonna keep on doin' that, as long as you keep walkin' over to me for info."
// Answer Text :
"P1463845317" "Good to know Dean."
// Page RunningBack Text :
"P2434586518" "Far as I'm concerned, them guys in the PPD? Dead to me. Least figuratively, if not literally just yet.<br><br>Them cops in the force, they became my enemies the day they said what <i>I</i> did was wrong, meanwhile they're fine with letting folks jump through loopholes to get away with murder. You don't gotta worry about me, {HeroName}. I'm in this thing to win it."
// Answer Text :
"P3699324744" "Perfect Dean."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - LeonardWarehouse 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P3823246493" "<color orange>Leonard looks battered and beaten, as if he has been held hostage in here for quite some time.</color><br><br>Who...who are you...?<br><br>Please...you have to help me...I don't even know how long I've been down here for...!"
// Answer Text :
"P2150633251" "Cut the act Leonard. What's going on here?"
// Answer Text :
"P4280113554" "Leonard? What are you doing here?"
// Page Other Text :
"P636200460" "You've got to stop the 5th Column!"
// Answer Text :
"P3801452557" "Just stay down!"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P164620616" "What act? Look at me! <br><br>If I was playing some sort of act, I assure you I would have stopped it long before it involved being <i>beaten</i> by these people."
// Answer Text :
"P1734512257" "What are you planning with Mane?"
// Page Manes Text :
"P218497576" "Mane? <br><br>Mane is <color red>dead</color>! I saw him killed with my own eyes, that's why I came to the Isles!"
// Answer Text :
"P1788913239" "The files said you're working with the PPD to get Mane back!"
// Page WorkingwithPPD Text :
"P1172705591" "That's because I couldn't tell them what I saw.<br><br>Or at least...what I <i>thought</i> I saw."
// Answer Text :
"P2016910215" "Alright, what did you see?"
// Page WhatISaw Text :
"P1535148136" "<color orange>Before Leonard can explain what's going on, an alarm goes off in the warehouse. It looks like the 5th Column are well aware of your presence here!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1226212057" "Just stay right here, Leonard."
// Page HowIendeduphere Text :
"P2134222126" "I found out that some people had seen Thomas Mane going in and out of this warehouse. I couldn't believe it though - I <i>knew</i> Thomas Mane was dead.<br><br>I came down here to investigate, only to be attacked by the 5th Column!<br><br>I was able to fight them off for a while, until I saw him - Thomas Mane in the flesh."
// Page GoOn Text :
"P1306319459" "He lunged at me with some sort of energy glowing around his fists - I was on the ground before I knew what happened.<br><br>Mane stood over me, grinning like a maniac. That's when I saw - his face...his body...is began to <color red>change, to shift!</color><br><br>First back to Dr. Zeist...then to Mane...then to a form I recognized."
// Answer Text :
"P2213821938" "Who was it?"
// Page Protean Text :
"P1092999218" "It was <color red>Protean</color>!<br><br>He's a shapeshifter - he killed Manticore's parents and Dauntless, Galaxy Girl's sidekick. I knew all about him from the papers.<br><br>I thought that Manticore had killed Protean though...*<br><br>Before I passed out, I saw one last image that still haunts me - Protean shapeshifting into <color red>me</color>.<br><br>{HeroName}, if you've been talking to me in Sharkhead, it can only mean one thing -<br><br><br><br><scale.6>*See Issues 7-9 of the City of Heroes' Comics"
// Answer Text :
"P763613402" "...I've been dealing with Protean this whole time."
// Page DealingwithProtean Text :
"P4163962347" "What has he been doing as me all this time?"
// Answer Text :
"P1592201841" "(Explain the situation to Leonard)"
// Page TheSituation Text :
"P1637991849" "Cloning facility?<br><br>He must be working with the 5th Column then...using the money he stole from Mane Corp to fund this! But...what is he planning?"
// Answer Text :
"P1114620868" "I don't know, but right now he has a factory full of my clones at his disposal."
// Page FactoryofMe Text :
"P2457939335" "That's...not good.<br><br>Look, I'm going to get out of here, I'll try to track down, well...<i>me</i>.<br><br>I'll meet you up top. Maybe if we're lucky, we can catch Protean before he gets to that factory."
// Answer Text :
"P3256583885" "Alright, let's move."
// Page Move Text :
"P2590554710" "<color orange>Leonard rises to his feet and runs as fast as he can to get back topside."
// Answer Text :
"P679683951" "I better do the same...!"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P2015053440" "How do you know me?<br><br>Wait...no...<i>no</i>!<br><br>You must have talked to him!"
// Answer Text :
"P414883124" "Him?"
// Page HimWho Text :
"P2354601653" "Using ME to do whatever he wants...I can't believe this...I shouldn't have been so foolish as to try to come here alone."
// Answer Text :
"P3013927201" "You're not making any sense!"
// Page AnySense Text :
"P893693698" "Okay...alright, look, I'll start from the beginning.<br><br>You know of Thomas Mane, right? He's who you're looking for?<br><br>Well...Mane is <color red>dead</color>."
// Answer Text :
"P1333275818" "Dead? How?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3074685970" "Greetings {HeroName}. At the moment, we're doing everything we can to get your facility up and running.<br><br>There's nothing further that you need to do - simply sit back and wait, or go about your normal business. I will let you know when everything is settled."
// AcceptString :
"P4279249278" "Very well, good job Leonard."
// SendOffString :
"P2997499258" "Of course {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}.<br><br><color orange>You should use this time to dig deeper into Mane Corp. While they're helping you out tremendously, you have nothing to hold over them, should they try to backstab you.<br><br>What you need right now is information, and you know the exact person who can get you it - <color yellow>Dean MacArthur</color>.<br><br>You'll have to ensure that Mane Corp isn't aware of your digging around - not just yet."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1322148658" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: What I Saw</color>"

