// EntryString :
"P389812198" "You enter the warehouse to find the first level devoid of any sound. It's run down, with the security cameras not operational. <br><br>If Mane Corp is here, they're not trying too hard to keep this place in shape.<br><br>You find a piece of paper on the floor with a series of numbers on it - it seems to be half of someone's bank account information."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2878478748" "Find out what Leonard is doing here"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P517583519" "5th Column Soldier"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P355899784" "Where do we need this to go?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P353032494" "You're not supposed to be down here!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1574800225" "5th Column Organizer"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3502206553" "Hold on, let me check..."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P633015609" "Intruder!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4283702989" "I hate this gig. I want to be out there fighting in Boomtown."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P647238397" "We've all got to do our parts. When we've taken control of the world, then we can bask."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3097235464" "You're just one more obstacle to be taken care of!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3644619513" "What's the status on those clones?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P439404685" "The ones of {HeroName}? Yeah I think they're taking off real well."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P4117921723" "{HeroName}! You're not one of the clones...are you?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2453051593" "What're we doing with the prisoner?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2083126166" "He wants that guy drilled for any more info, then we're dumping him."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3164024002" "Is someone going out for food later on?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3818217111" "We sent Steinbeck before. Don't even think of going out yourself, we need to maintain our cover in here."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3376604373" "<shout>We've got orders from Protean! Kill {HeroName}!"

