// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2014583968" "Time to head back up top to get some answers from Leonard."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3371708119" "{HeroName}, I've got it all figured out.<br><br>This has all been the work of <color red>Protean, the shapeshifter who killed the hero Manticore's parents!</color><br><br>He is the one who killed Thomas Mane, then assumed his form to steal everything from Mane Corp! I came here to get answers, only to be taken prisoner by Protean when I ended up in that warehouse.<br><br><color red>This entire time, you've been dealing with Protean who assumed my form!</color><br><br>I can only assume that he's done all this to fund whatever project you're working on for himself!"
// RandomFameString :
"P3759275881" "I heard Independence Port is a wreck thanks to a large attack by the Freakshow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - LeonardFinal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P953392320" "Hello {HeroName}. I saw what happened. Everything destroyed.<br><br>I...apologize, for all your hard work to have gone to waste..."
// Answer Text :
"P674124024" "I'm aware of that, Leonard."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1893885377" "I wish there was something I could do to make it up to you, {HeroName}.<br><br>Unfortunately, all I have is part of the account information where Protean transferred all of Mane Corps' money.<br><br><color orange>You remember that you have in your possession a piece of paper you found back in that old warehouse. That paper contained the other half of the account information!<br><br>Even though Protean destroyed your lab, you can have the last laugh by taking <i>all</i> of Protean's money for yourself! If...when he tries to make his next move, he'll find himself <i>quite</i> drained of all his funds."
// Answer Text :
"P4119402055" "Give me that information, Leonard."
// Page Info Text :
"P2196569876" "What?<br><br>....<br><br>Ah. Yes...here you go. I understand, {HeroName}.<br><br>The time for Mane Corp...has come to an end. I would rather use this to finally bury the corporation once and for all - and to get vengeance against Protean. <br><br>You can use this to transfer all the funds from his wireless account - you wouldn't even need to <i>rob</i> the bank, just simply get an electronic transfer."
// Answer Text :
"P1187696371" "We'll see what happens."
// Answer Text :
"P3557497274" "You don't want a cut of this?"
// Page WantaCut Text :
"P226270898" "No, {HeroName}. You don't understand.<br><br>I've spent the past ten, fifteen years of my life, following around Thomas Mane. Even before the corporation was formed.<br><br>All for the hopes of one day being successful with Mane Corp. I didn't even <i>care</i> for Mane Corp, to be honest. And now look at me, {HeroName}.<br><br>Mane Corp has left me with nothing at all, no friends, no family.<br><br>I want nothing at all to do with Mane Corp, even if it means the promise of all this money. I know now that...I can't rely on that, anymore."
// Answer Text :
"P2958230071" "Alright Leonard."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - BankTeller 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Third Text :
"P2459225892" "{HeroName}...! L-look...just take everything! We won't stop you!<br><br>Just don't hurt me!"
// Answer Text :
"P773726381" "I'm here to make a wireless transaction."
// Page Second2 Text :
"P1677508460" "I-is there anything else?"
// Answer Text :
"P430112420" "No, I'm done here."
// Page InformationPage12 Text :
"P10237753" "Y-you're - what? A wireless transaction?<br><br>From...who..?"
// Answer Text :
"P1617988362" "(Hand the teller Thomas Mane's information)"
// Page Mane2 Text :
"P1593548933" "Okay...okay, we can do this.<br><br>Get {HeroName} this transaction, NOW!<br><br>It'll just take a few minutes, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P1217311590" "Alright..."
// Page FewMinutes2 Text :
"P3500483826" ".....<br><br>....<br><br>So...ah..."
// Answer Text :
"P1216848434" "No need for small talk."
// Page SmallTalk2 Text :
"P2107527138" "Ah...okay...of course.<br><br>....<br><br>...."
// Answer Text :
"P708901319" "....."
// Page Time2 Text :
"P518440012" "All of the funds from this account have been transferred to your own, {HeroName}.<br><br>And might I add, we're all <i>very</i> appreciative that you chose not to rob our bank today."
// Answer Text :
"P3126882535" "You're welcome."
// Answer Text :
"P3968843136" "Who said I wasn't going to rob the bank after the transfer?"
// Page Welcome2 Text :
"P969934472" "T-thank you. H-have a good day {Hero.gender=male sir|miss}."
// Answer Text :
"P3790850722" "Oh I will, trust me."
// Page Rob2 Text :
"P1528565717" "Y-you...<br><br>I-I'm getting out of here! Security...!"
// Answer Text :
"P2696488134" "You're not required now, anyway."
// Page InformationPage22 Text :
"P2742180860" "Ahhhh!<br><br>W-whatever you say! What do you want?!"
// Answer Text :
"P92121106" "Transfer everything from this account to my account, NOW!"
// Page DoItNow2 Text :
"P4078783671" "Okay...o-okay! T-transfer the funds to {HeroName}'s account as fast as possible!"
// Answer Text :
"P1239539139" "Hurry it up!"
// Page HurryNow2 Text :
"P160747741" "It's going to t-take a few moments!"
// Answer Text :
"P366007360" "Don't try to pull any tricks, understand?"
// Page NoTricks2 Text :
"P4180553013" "Yes..of course...no tricks, I swear we wouldn't!<br><br>Just please don't hurt me!"
// Answer Text :
"P2368082882" "I just might if it takes any longer!"
// Page IfItTakes2 Text :
"P208163099" "There! There it's done!<br><br>Now please, leave us alone...you've got what you wanted!"
// Answer Text :
"P2815481010" "Consider yourself lucky today."
// Answer Text :
"P2360476162" "I don't think so. I'm taking everything else here also!"
// Page InformationPage32 Text :
"P1619634123" "Oh...okay...okay...calming...calming down...what...what do you need transferred?"
// Answer Text :
"P20107345" "See this here paper? Everything from here, into my account."
// Page ThisHerePaper2 Text :
"P682807983" "Okay...Chuck..! <br><br>GIVE HIM WHAT HE WANTS, NOW!"
// Answer Text :
"P1376151075" "...! No need to yell at the man, take it easy."
// Page TakeItEasy2 Text :
"P3848780792" "He needs the motivation.<br><br>Why are you so calm anyway...? Isn't this a robbery?"
// Answer Text :
"P4138601489" "I'm not the intimidating kind of {Hero.gender=male guy|gal}, you know?"
// Page NotIntimidating2 Text :
"P1823331441" "Right...okay...sure thing...<br><br>It'll just be another moment for the transfer to go through."
// Answer Text :
"P2058912412" "No problem, take it easy. This is cake compared to what I just went through."
// Page ThisisCake2 Text :
"P3905413406" "Okay, there. All the money is transferred over. <br><br>I have to say, thank you very much {HeroName} for not robbing us blind!<br><br>It's good to know there are people as relaxing as you in the Isles."
// Answer Text :
"P2931255992" "Hey, forget about it, don't mention it. Take it easy."
// Answer Text :
"P3843847356" "Whoah hold on. I might be relaxed, but it doesn't mean I'm not robbing this place blind."
// Page WelcomeRelax2 Text :
"P1555584080" "Thank you. H-have a good day {Hero.gender=male sir|miss}."
// Answer Text :
"P496787049" "Here we go with the security..."
// Answer Text :
"P876264431" "Calm down. I'm here to make a wireless transaction."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DownClone 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3039792286" "The...original...the...c-creator...!<br><br>Please...help...can't...get up...please...!"
// Answer Text :
"P1303258168" "(Save the clone)"
// Answer Text :
"P273352186" "(Leave the clone its fate, there's no time!)"
// Answer Text :
"P1315417401" "(Finish off the clone to deal with any liabilities)"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P823887885" "<color orange>You help the clone back to its feet, allowing it to escape.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3134293117" "(Get out!)"
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P4232840110" "<color orange>You finish off the clone, preventing it from getting out of the factory.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NewClone 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1865277075" "Hello, Creator. I didn't get a chance to show my...thanks, for saving me in the laboratory.<br><br>I was able to recover quickly, thanks to...well...having your abilities.<br><br>But I must ask you...why did you save me? You could have left me to die...but instead, you chose to once more give me life.<br><br>Why?"
// Answer Text :
"P3480554475" "I did it so you could work under me."
// Answer Text :
"P1053579017" "I did it just to save you. Go live your life."
// Answer Text :
"P306634305" "I did it because I did it, I don't have a reason."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P644313589" "Serve you...?<br><br>No...no Creator, I have no intent on serving you. I want to <i>see</i> this world, outside of the tube, of the crate, of the chamber!<br><br>I nearly died without ever seeing the outside world. <br><br>Now I intend to see all of it - on my terms. I will not be bound to anyone again. Not even you, my Creator."
// Answer Text :
"P4060574684" "I'm not going to just let you go that easily. (Attack!)"
// Answer Text :
"P601973148" "Fine, go. Be free, do what you wish to do."
// Page AttackClone Text :
"P3389620684" "<color orange>You lunge forward to attack your clone!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1769815256" "(Finish this off!)"
// Page BeFree Text :
"P3006376547" "<color orange>Your clone turns and walks off at your words."
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P2700458013" "Just...like that, Creator? You do not want me to owe you any debt? Anything?"
// Answer Text :
"P3481245846" "I said go."
// Answer Text :
"P4156630162" "I want to know one thing. What are you going to do?"
// Page WhatToDo Text :
"P3492232431" "I...well...I don't know. I barely know much about this world, about this life.<br><br>All that was ingrained into my mind was the knowledge and will to fight. But in those final moments within the lab...I wanted to know so much more. What was outside of this lab? Of this island? My regret was that I was going to die without having an answer to those questions...until you saved me.<br><br>I don't exactly know what I'm going to do, or where I'm going to go. But I know that I want to see this world, experience everything in it. And to understand why it feels as if I'm missing something...a part of me feels...hollow. I do not know how to explain it."
// Answer Text :
"P2054756001" "Fair enough. Go, live your life."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P818265169" "I...guess that is a good enough reason. I am happy to just be alive.<br><br>So...is that it then, between you and I? You do not need anything else?"
// Answer Text :
"P2477911820" "Well, now that you're here, you're going to follow my commands, of course."
// Answer Text :
"P2557959861" "Nope. That's it. You can go now."
// Page FollowCommands Text :
"P2139239460" "Follow your commands...?<br><br>No...no Creator, I have no intent on following you. I...apologize, really.<br><br> I want to <i>see</i> this world, outside of the tube, of the crate, of the chamber!<br><br>I nearly died without ever seeing the outside world. <br><br>Now I intend to see all of it - on my terms. I will not be bound to anyone again. Not even you, my Creator."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
