// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P64523064" "{HeroName}, I must again apol-"
// AcceptString :
"P1049490423" "Enough with the apologies Leonard. Just stay here. I'm going after Protean."
// SendOffString :
"P2079839141" "Ah...yes, of course. Very well. I will do everything I can from up here to prevent him from sending in any reinforcements.<br><br><color red>I would be very careful if I was you, {HeroName}. I fought Protean once and he was terribly strong. This may be a fight you cannot win on your own.</color>.<br><br>That is all I will say - I shall not delay you any further."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P280458675" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: The Bigger Villain</color>"

