"P2276894680" "<t=4 caption y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Black>Well well...if it isn't {HeroName}. I'm glad you arrived.<t=4 caption y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Black>I enjoyed toying with you as Leonard. It was quite delightful<t=4 caption y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Black>Please, do try to find me. I'll enjoy ripping your head off!"
