// 6 Protean :
"P647550620" "<em t=2 d=3><color white><bgcolor Black>Everything is complete.<em t=4 d=4><color white><bgcolor Black>{HeroName}'s clones are prepared and the Column know nothing of the invasion."
// 5 Caption :
"P4147900608" "<x=0.9 y=0.5 d=5 t=5><scale 2.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGreen>I trust you have plans to handle {HeroName}'s intervention?"
// 3 Protean :
"P2108123318" "<em t=2 d=3><color white><bgcolor Black>Of course. I will kill {Hero.gender=male him|her} myself."
// 5 Caption :
"P2850024351" "<x=0.1 y=0.5 d=5 t=5><scale 2.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGreen>Do not underestimate {HeroName}, Protean."
// 5 Caption :
"P2857247687" "<x=0.1 y=0.5 d=5 t=5><scale 2.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGreen>Especially considering {Hero.gender=male he has|she has} made it past your defenses."
// 6 Protean :
"P3074472198" "<em t=3 d=3><color white><bgcolor Black>Good, I'll just need a moment to tear {Hero.gender=male him|her} apart. <em t=3 d=4><color white><bgcolor Black>When I am finished with {HeroName}, who should I look for in Praetoria?"
// 5 Caption :
"P318268148" "<x=0.1 y=0.5 d=5 t=5><scale 2.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGreen>Mr. G will be waiting for you."

